The storefront now reads as a florist's studio rather than a generic boutique. I rebuilt the visual system around pressed-paper warmth, botanical line art and arched frames, then applied it across the customer-facing pages.

**What changed**

- **Palette & type** — [index.css](web/src/index.css) has a warmer paper cream, a deeper forest green, and new terracotta "clay" and dusty-rose accents; Fraunces now loads its italic axis so headline words can be set in soft italic (e.g. "We bring the *season* to life").
- **Signature shapes** — reused `.arch` / `.arch-soft` domed photo frames for category tiles, product cards, the story image, the gallery, thumbnails and collection tiles, plus asymmetric "petal" corners on promise and testimonial cards.
- **Botanical detailing** — new inline `Blossom` and `Sprig` line-art ornaments in [ui.jsx](web/src/components/ui.jsx), replacing the ✿ emoji in the logo, section eyebrows, footer and the deal medallion; a faint paper grain and pressed-fern watermark sit behind the light sections.
- **Header** — [Navbar.jsx](web/src/components/Navbar.jsx): deep-green announcement strip, blossom mark, serif wordmark with terracotta sub-line, arched mega-menu thumbnails on cream.
- **Home** — [Home.jsx](web/src/pages/Home.jsx), [HeroSlider.jsx](web/src/components/home/HeroSlider.jsx), [CategoryDirectory.jsx](web/src/components/home/CategoryDirectory.jsx), [CategoryMosaic.jsx](web/src/components/home/CategoryMosaic.jsx), [DealOfTheDay.jsx](web/src/components/home/DealOfTheDay.jsx): botanical arched category wall, arched collection features, a sage-washed deal block with ringed product medallion, and a dark forest story/closing footer pairing.
- **Products & shop** — [ProductCard.jsx](web/src/components/ProductCard.jsx) cards now have domed photos, serif names and prices, hairlines and corner-safe badges; [Shop.jsx](web/src/pages/Shop.jsx) gained a fern-textured editorial banner; [ProductDetail.jsx](web/src/pages/ProductDetail.jsx) got an arched gallery and sage story panel.
- **Footer** — [Footer.jsx](web/src/components/Footer.jsx) is now a deep botanical close with a cream "bloom club" card and blossom rule.

**Verified** — production build passes (`npm run build`); rendered and inspected at 1440, 820 and 390 px with no horizontal overflow or console errors; admin dashboard and login flow still work. Computed contrast ratios: body ink 15.4:1, secondary text 7.3:1, muted text 5.0:1, clay labels 5.5:1 on cream and 5.1:1 on parchment, cream-on-forest 11.7:1. No test suite exists in the repo, so the build plus browser checks are the verification.

The dev server is running and the storefront is in the Preview tab.

